  "reviews": [
    {
      "game": "Avatar: Frontiers of Pandora",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/9014/450x258/avatar-frontiers-of-pandora-pc-game-ubisoft-connect-europe-cover.jpg?v=1794085200",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/9014-buy-avatar-frontiers-of-pandora-pc-game-ubisoft-connect-europe/",
      "user": "gamer-dacf202",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "As an Avatar fan, I really love this game. Started with the movies this year and playing AFOP really fuelled my interest. \n\n\n\nThe game is great for people who are interested in the Avatar lore/story. Good to experience Pandora on their own."
    },
    {
      "game": "The Sims 4 Enchanted by Nature",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/19348/450x258/the-sims-4-enchanted-by-nature-pc-mac-ea-app-cover.jpg?v=1794085200",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/19348-buy-the-sims-4-enchanted-by-nature-pc-mac-ea-app/",
      "user": "gamer-833936a",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "Wouldn't have gotten it had it not been on sale on Instant Gaming but it's a beautiful pack, lots of gorgeous build/buy stuff, lots to explore in the new world too. Hilarious seeing fairys full wings out at random other spots too."
    },
    {
      "game": "Dark Souls 3 Deluxe Edition",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/2060/450x258/dark-souls-3-deluxe-edition-pc-steam-cover.jpg?v=1794085200",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/2060-buy-dark-souls-3-deluxe-edition-pc-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-c4cc62d",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "It was great, very Dark Souls. I got all the way to the Lord of Cinder but took a detour to fight Lady Friede, which was a huge mistake. After finally getting to her third stage, which I had no idea existed, she filled me with a quiet rage that had me silently delete my character and pull apart my controller with my bare hands. RIP."
    },
    {
      "game": "Forspoken",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/16168/450x258/forspoken-playstation-5-game-playstation-store-cover.jpg?v=1794085200",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/16168-buy-forspoken-playstation-5-game-playstation-store/",
      "user": "TTVAna_Frenchy",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/avatars/15585344-1794052205.jpg",
      "sentiment": "like",
      "content": "I personally enjoyed the premise and the base storyline of this game. I really didn't see the plot twist in the end and was pleasantly surprised by some of the reveals... The little cat companions that you can collect around the map are cute and a nice little addition to the game. \n\n\n\n The visuals are amazing, and the power system is honestly so freaking fun to play with. The powers are based on elements, and each element comes with a dozen+ spells to master. In the end, you feel like the avatar as you switch from one element to another depending on your needs. Each quest/boss that you fight for the first time is super fun. \n\n\n\nHowever, because the map is so vast, all the side quests get so repetitive over time. If you're like me and you like to grind your way to max levels, it gets annoying. Something else that I need someone to create a mod for is the constant dialogue between the main character and her bracelet. I laughed once or twice the first time I heard some of their replies, but after 10-15 minutes, it gets so annoying. At some point, since I was only grinding levels and leveling up my elements, I ended up muting the dialogue in the whole game since I wasn't doing any story quests XD It's THAT bad, sadly. Because of the crazy graphics, sadly, you need a really good PC if you're not playing on a PS5. And the game is so ridiculously heavy; if you have a limited amount of storage, forget about it, you won't make it. \n\n\n\nEither way, I've always been a sucker for a good underdog, so I'm glad I was able to still enjoy the game despite all of its flaws! Can't wait to complete the DLC so I can finally delete it from my computer and free up some space! XD"
    }
  ],
